     The BBUUFF__TTIIMMEELLOOCCKK() function locks the given buffer, and limits the amount
     of time it will sleep to _t_i_m_o and OR's _c_a_t_c_h into the sleep's priority.
     _w_m_e_s_g is the wmesg used in the sleep.

