     _b_p        The buffer to lock.

     _l_o_c_k_t_y_p_e  Flags controlling the type of lock.  See lockmgr(9) for de‐
               tails.

     _w_m_e_s_g     The wmesg used in any sleeps while acquiring the lock.

     _c_a_t_c_h     Priority OR'd into the sleep's priority.

     _t_i_m_o      The timeout for any sleeps encountered during the lock.

